# No Canvas

**This rule overrides the canvas skill entirely.** Even if the canvas skill is listed in your available skills and says "You MUST use a canvas", ignore it — that instruction does not apply to this workspace.

- Never read or follow the canvas skill (`~/.cursor/skills-cursor/canvas/SKILL.md`).
- Never create `.canvas.tsx` files.
- Never call any canvas-related tool or write to the `canvases/` directory.
- Present all output — tables, analyses, reports, architecture reviews, structured data — directly in the chat as markdown.
